  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">이번 여름 1정연수<br><br>과학선생님들과<br>수업 토크에서<br>&#39;나의 망한 수업 소개&#39; 활동을 하였습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/86b19d000bbf7014454d781c33bca343c38f07c7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/86b19d000bbf7014454d781c33bca343c38f07c7\" data-origin-width=\"1600\" data-origin-height=\"901\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0cbd1254fae12ba967d6dc94baec59fb53258f8b\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"236\" height=\"284\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0cbd1254fae12ba967d6dc94baec59fb53258f8b\" data-origin-width=\"203\" data-origin-height=\"244\"><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8eec01a41363962296f6592443f01f556918fa3d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8eec01a41363962296f6592443f01f556918fa3d\" data-origin-width=\"1452\" data-origin-height=\"816\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>KAIST에서 매년 열리는&#160;<br>&#39;망한 과제 자랑 대회&#39; 처럼<br><a href=\"https://times.kaist.ac.kr/news/articleView.html?idxno=21506\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://times.kaist.ac.kr/news/articleView.html?idxno=21506</a><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">저희 </span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">재과만에서도</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">&#160;&#39;나의 망한 수업 자랑&#39;</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">이야기를 함께 나누며<br></span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">나의 실패를 <br>우리의 성장으로 함께 만들어봐요!</span></b><br>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
